WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.873 --> 00:00:16.363
Ben watched the net of balloons carefully, still holding his breath.

2
00:00:18.524 --> 00:00:20.826
But to his dismay, nothing happened.

3
00:00:23.668 --> 00:00:28.512
He looked over at Gaby and realized that a knot in the rope prevented the net from falling.

4
00:00:30.384 --> 00:00:33.987
She was stretching as high as she could, but she couldn't reach the knot.

5
00:00:37.149 --> 00:00:38.230
She waved Ben over.

6
00:00:38.250 --> 00:00:41.832
"You can reach it," she mouthed.

7
00:00:43.433 --> 00:00:44.934
Ben zoomed over to the knot.

8
00:00:45.515 --> 00:00:49.137
Below, the audience in the risers began to cheer and clap.

9
00:00:49.938 --> 00:00:53.100
Zork had reached the other side of the high wire without falling.

10
00:00:53.120 --> 00:00:56.242
"Hooray!" a goblin shouted.

11
00:00:56.262 --> 00:00:57.503
"He did it!"

12
00:00:57.523 --> 00:00:59.064
"That's a relief!"

13
00:00:59.488 --> 00:01:01.669
Ben thought as he started working on the knot.

14
00:01:02.510 --> 00:01:04.811
Unfortunately, it was slow work.

15
00:01:05.311 --> 00:01:10.034
The rope had frayed, and Ben's fingers trembled as he tried to undo the tight knot.

16
00:01:10.974 --> 00:01:12.275
"Ugh!" he groaned.

17
00:01:12.295 --> 00:01:14.136
"This is going to take forever!"

18
00:01:14.156 --> 00:01:15.897
"You can do it!"

19
00:01:16.377 --> 00:01:17.438
Gaby called up to him.

20
00:01:17.458 --> 00:01:18.638
"Don't give up!"

21
00:01:19.679 --> 00:01:23.121
A second later an amazed gasp rose from the crowd.

22
00:01:25.022 --> 00:01:28.684
Ben looked down to see Maddy juggling dodo eggs with her tentacles.

23
00:01:30.932 --> 00:01:36.435
She stepped down from the stage and began walking, mixing among the audience members who were sitting near

24
00:01:36.455 --> 00:01:37.556
the front of the stage.

25
00:01:38.436 --> 00:01:41.098
For a moment the crowd seemed to enjoy her act.

26
00:01:41.998 --> 00:01:48.362
Then—whoosh! Maddy shot out one of her tentacles and grabbed a small, three-eyed monster.

27
00:01:48.462 --> 00:01:53.625
The tiny monster cried in surprise as Maddy tossed him into the air with the dodo eggs.

28
00:01:53.645 --> 00:01:55.726
"Hey!" he yelled.

29
00:01:55.746 --> 00:01:57.167
"Stop juggling me!

30
00:01:57.187 --> 00:01:58.988
I'm not a dodo egg!"

31
00:01:59.872 --> 00:02:01.913
The monster's mother jumped to her feet.

32
00:02:01.933 --> 00:02:03.254
"Mr. Freaky!

33
00:02:03.614 --> 00:02:04.595
Do something!"

34
00:02:04.615 --> 00:02:06.236
"Oh dear!"

35
00:02:07.456 --> 00:02:09.778
Mr. Freaky tried to get close to Maddy.

36
00:02:10.318 --> 00:02:12.119
One of her tentacles knocked him over.

37
00:02:12.139 --> 00:02:16.422
"Ben, hurry!"

38
00:02:16.762 --> 00:02:17.542
Gaby urged.

39
00:02:17.562 --> 00:02:18.863
"I'm trying!"

40
00:02:19.123 --> 00:02:19.784
Ben said.

41
00:02:19.804 --> 00:02:21.665
"I'm going as fast as I can!"

42
00:02:22.485 --> 00:02:27.148
For the next minute, Ben worked on the knot while stealing quick glances at the scene below.

43
00:02:27.716 --> 00:02:32.319
The audience watched uneasily as Maddy juggled dodo eggs and the young monster.

44
00:02:32.839 --> 00:02:39.422
A surprised shout rang out when she suddenly reached into the crowd again, grabbing a second monster child.

45
00:02:40.383 --> 00:02:47.167
Sarah Swingwire raced toward Maddy, desperately waving her arms and snapping her gum to get the octopus monster's

46
00:02:47.187 --> 00:02:49.668
attention. But it was no use.

47
00:02:50.288 --> 00:02:54.651
The crowd was still too loud, and Maddy was paying no attention to Sarah.

48
00:02:56.112 --> 00:03:01.694
By now her eyes were locked on something else in the crowd—little Timothy Hubbletree.

49
00:03:01.714 --> 00:03:05.235
"That octopus monster wants to juggle me!"

50
00:03:05.496 --> 00:03:06.376
Timothy shouted.

51
00:03:06.876 --> 00:03:12.699
Mayor Hubbletree leaped to his feet, frantically trying to shield Timothy from Maddy's flying tentacles.

52
00:03:17.200 --> 00:03:18.701
the mayor yelled furiously.

53
00:03:18.721 --> 00:03:24.423
"If anything happens to my son, you're in big trouble!"

54
00:03:24.443 --> 00:03:27.249
Mr. Freaky stood back up, his noses wiggling.

55
00:03:27.269 --> 00:03:32.314
"Stop juggling those children right now, Maddy!"

56
00:03:32.934 --> 00:03:34.395
Maddy didn't seem to hear him.

57
00:03:35.036 --> 00:03:37.198
The principal looked at Ringmaster Ronny.

58
00:03:38.159 --> 00:03:39.940
"Why is Maddy acting like this?

59
00:03:40.421 --> 00:03:41.682
Is this part of her act?"

60
00:03:42.342 --> 00:03:43.563
The ringmaster shrugged.

61
00:03:43.583 --> 00:03:45.345
"I don't know what's going on.

62
00:03:45.585 --> 00:03:47.747
We've never worked with monsters before.

63
00:03:48.167 --> 00:03:50.490
And we probably never will again!"

64
00:03:51.430 --> 00:03:53.012
Ben swung back to the knot.

65
00:03:53.620 --> 00:03:57.503
He'd almost untangled it when the crowd below went completely silent.

66
00:03:58.023 --> 00:03:59.844
A chill ran up Ben's spine.

67
00:04:00.305 --> 00:04:01.465
Now what was happening?

68
00:04:02.186 --> 00:04:03.587
A new act had started.

69
00:04:04.107 --> 00:04:09.891
Deb hung upside down from the trapeze bar by her knees, holding Winnie by the arms and swinging

70
00:04:09.951 --> 00:04:10.852
her back and forth.

71
00:04:11.372 --> 00:04:15.735
When Deb let go, Winnie was supposed to sail toward another trapeze bar.

72
00:04:16.836 --> 00:04:21.599
But as Deb swung her, Winnie missed—and sailed out over the audience!

73
00:04:22.279 --> 00:04:23.100
Ben gasped.

74
00:04:23.592 --> 00:04:25.294
"Winnie!" he shouted.

75
00:04:25.314 --> 00:04:31.458
"No!" Everyone in the room seemed to hold their breath until Winnie somehow managed to reach out and

76
00:04:31.558 --> 00:04:34.840
grab one of the metal rafters running across the ceiling.

77
00:04:34.860 --> 00:04:38.163
"Whew!" Ben said.

78
00:04:38.743 --> 00:04:40.685
Thank goodness Winnie was safe.

79
00:04:41.305 --> 00:04:43.827
Mr. Freaky rushed to the microphone onstage.

80
00:04:43.847 --> 00:04:46.849
"Please calm down, everyone."

81
00:04:47.349 --> 00:04:48.370
He blew his noses.

82
00:04:51.776 --> 00:04:57.360
"There's nothing to worry about—everything is totally under control!"

83
00:04:57.380 --> 00:04:59.422
"Are you kidding?"

84
00:05:00.022 --> 00:05:01.283
Mayor Hubbletree shouted.

85
00:05:02.063 --> 00:05:03.985
"Nothing is under control here!

86
00:05:04.465 --> 00:05:07.887
Every time I come here, there's total chaos!"

87
00:05:07.908 --> 00:05:10.850
"Mayor Hubbletree is right," Ben thought.

88
00:05:11.210 --> 00:05:16.073
He guessed he had only seconds before the gym really did descend into total chaos.

89
00:05:17.674 --> 00:05:19.656
Finally he untied the knot.

90
00:05:21.652 --> 00:05:24.374
"Yes!" he cried as the net swung open.

91
00:05:24.394 --> 00:05:31.240
The stunned audience looked up, mesmerized as hundreds of colorful balloons drifted down toward them.

92
00:05:32.521 --> 00:05:36.765
Ben drew in a breath, frantically trying to locate Waldo in the crowd.

93
00:05:37.245 --> 00:05:41.729
At last he spotted him—standing in perfect position in front of the risers.

94
00:05:41.749 --> 00:05:44.852
"It's up to you now, Waldo," Ben thought.

95
00:05:44.872 --> 00:05:46.933
"Please don't mess this up!"

96
00:05:47.974 --> 00:05:50.512
Waldo waved his wand and—poof!

97
00:05:50.532 --> 00:05:52.555
Little Timothy turned into a porcupine!

98
00:05:52.575 --> 00:05:54.538
"Oh no!"

99
00:05:54.979 --> 00:05:55.680
Ben cried.

100
00:05:55.700 --> 00:05:57.602
"That's it!"

101
00:05:58.063 --> 00:05:59.345
Mayor Hubbletree shouted.

102
00:05:59.365 --> 00:06:03.371
"This place is a a circus!"
